{"reviewId": "426066534_88vKUgSkD", "review": {"abstract": "2016年即将启动本次中周期第三库存周期，这个库存周期源于中国房地产周期的B浪反弹，以及美国房地产周期的高位延续，周期复苏和货币乘数上升将给全球带来一次小的滞胀过程，我们认为这可以被视为商品的一次触底", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "我看书友问ai得出2026会有一个第三库存周期反弹。但是从上帝视角来看，2016年后的反弹依旧很大程度是依靠房地产投资，那么2026能刻舟求剑吗？不能全信，只能说ai提供了一个角度", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "31344-31444", "createTime": 1776697543, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "426066534_88vKUgSkD", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1776697758, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 396659441, "name": "多喜乐🌸࿐ ಇ上上ജ签", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/VBLEAcychgYPH3fXeOOLOUEYZmajIib0ZTgz2f8mibbIfrnPOLW3t4CQm9HYem2DyOzsC2ovUjf1mLRK9cM9icQ1ibQKz3AEPIG5qvrRs7yKCEo/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241216-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 